            <div xml:id="m-ac655763-70ef-413c-94b3-38dfcf5dabc9">
              <lg xml:id="m-21de1b1a-b144-47f9-8940-2cb385b46a54">
                <l xml:id="m-537b9c38-45b0-4aac-8445-a5c7ef3a5d32" facs="#m-83219639-0a35-4f98-a097-d99aae8a8457" label="ambiguous">522</l><l xml:id="m-73154f17-fe09-4b9b-ac1e-759e3f79311b" facs="#m-90cf14d4-e68e-4caf-9c69-3b1d2b7f3781" label="ambiguous">Ash Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-e788f4a9-1e4a-41ee-ba7e-4c1a087e104a" facs="#m-02358abc-6d58-4475-9daf-c8bdd401a458" label="lyrics-like">est mi-se-ri-cór- di- a tú- a: secúndum multi-tú¬ di¬</l><l xml:id="m-24823fa0-13f3-431a-826e-8e8cdbaebb9b" facs="#m-f892d43f-149d-4b67-bd24-8ee79cbe6eb9" label="lyrics-like">nem mi-se-ra-ti-ó-num tu¬ á-rum réspi-ce nos, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-82f6d5ec-d682-41db-b252-6343fc7db523" facs="#m-fac699e2-5b2f-4f1c-be78-840a0ea21dc5" label="lyrics-like">mi-ne. Ps. Sál-vum me fac Dé-us: quóni-am intravé-runt</l><l xml:id="m-7cca14c4-6599-40fb-aa65-dfb9c20cd10a" facs="#m-86fa8085-4546-4bb7-abf7-cbcd24fc656f" label="lyrics-like">áquae “ usque ad á-nimam mé- am. Gló- ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-00538063-3f16-40dd-98bf-fac4c699307c" facs="#m-84a9492d-9c65-4f02-b9bb-8f2079d69a23" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-079d3225-c60b-4d42-a8b8-8fc2b5942752" facs="#m-8baddff9-ae39-421c-95e5-6168a76e3f21" label="lyrics-like">Repeat: Exáudi no¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9111553-ce67-45af-9617-08c94305e799" facs="#m-1cadd90a-3e7b-407e-a636-18400fca5c84" label="text-like">The Celebrant then says:</l><l xml:id="m-fd6249d4-45a1-47e4-9d56-b43f61f39dd1" facs="#m-99fa749d-2d8e-4b79-bd59-47d780a0e4f9" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. E. Et cum spiritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-48e3b150-d190-4c8a-8a19-19498945254d" facs="#m-3ee65451-80fb-4437-98da-9a0906c2f13c" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-8675d69a-1d0b-4685-9951-6bc9b6c3a46c" facs="#m-cb34cddc-3973-4955-a0e2-592efdab9707" label="ambiguous">Prayers.</l><l xml:id="m-782d7772-75d4-4223-b69e-5c04ce616338" facs="#m-38158fa3-c3f7-4f01-93f0-20e430f8f348" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, nora sua deplorántibus, vel serenis¬</l><l xml:id="m-275c5d56-2f53-46ef-87b9-1ac81963adb9" facs="#m-21754c0a-11c7-474e-865d-5025fac7ef09" label="lyrics-like">U parce paeniténtibus, propitiáre</l><l xml:id="m-5bb682e6-464c-41f1-af4d-5ca5c28469fc" facs="#m-d71e02a7-3279-4c35-ad1d-949ea987823c" label="lyrics-like">simam pietâtem tuam suppliciter,</l><l xml:id="m-62a75597-4970-4f2c-a389-f8a4c5db50b3" facs="#m-f626d197-35a9-4066-b522-16198c76b12c" label="lyrics-like">supplicántibus, et mittere dignéris</l><l xml:id="m-4f55ad02-c5a0-4654-9e29-9d636f995cae" facs="#m-c301cdf9-99ec-431e-92c3-9f87ac19c084" label="lyrics-like">obnixéque flagitántibus : et praesta</l><l xml:id="m-5f72de63-cb6c-4199-b266-a283e581c086" facs="#m-e926f0a7-30ca-46d9-a420-54f77565c500" label="ambiguous">sanctum Angelum tuum de caelis,</l><l xml:id="m-339dd27a-1ee7-45a4-a220-ce83c7c674f3" facs="#m-ee658f2e-5716-47bc-b65a-c3bb714a5afe" label="lyrics-like">per invocatiónem sanctíssimi nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d8cf4f22-7df4-4ccc-bf0f-95b01bcc9583" facs="#m-fdf58c7d-6524-4243-931a-e00a1c49197e" label="ambiguous">qui bene Kdicat, et sancti Fficet</l><l xml:id="m-2166365d-692f-452c-88bf-9a5f2eea244b" facs="#m-7924a55a-acaa-4773-a7d7-94d075fb78cf" label="lyrics-like">minis tui; ut quicúmque per eos</l><l xml:id="m-96195ffd-7208-4226-9910-966c0b225424" facs="#m-c10048ee-e02f-41da-9a25-b2c6d8f4efc4" label="lyrics-like">aspérsi fúerint, pro redemptióne</l><l xml:id="m-6a4e9bf6-a30e-477f-8db7-11c24524c734" facs="#m-8092d88c-c3da-4e45-912e-c3c924d05031" label="lyrics-like">hios cineres, ut sint remédium salú¬</l><l xml:id="m-acefef90-dd5d-4204-8f3d-ff6552712187" facs="#m-6d10a5f2-e401-4802-82b3-5ae0e010fd07" label="lyrics-like">bre ómnibus nomen sanctum tuum</l><l xml:id="m-0713be35-0230-441e-9128-056ec1a6db19" facs="#m-9d998c11-29eb-42b9-a98d-f59701a1712c" label="lyrics-like">peccatórum suórum, córporis sani¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ce4a21f-f275-4196-bb19-dd706594e37c" facs="#m-6037fcbf-372f-41ed-8d52-8ed1b955e21f" label="lyrics-like">humiliter implorántibus, ac semet¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d57d7f2-ffdf-4e82-a27d-432936594430" facs="#m-b679f28e-e0f7-49a0-a775-12a919449389" label="lyrics-like">tátem, et ánimae tutélam perci¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae74b5d0-0431-499f-93c1-b8e28058e4ec" facs="#m-556624e6-d29d-43cb-84c7-1aceec009042" label="lyrics-like">piant. Per Christum Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-c879b1c2-9689-44b7-b1de-7189076e9441" facs="#m-aec191dd-26d1-4c17-85c4-2b95f688e77e" label="lyrics-like">Ipsos pro consciéntia delictórum</l><l xml:id="m-a4c1cadb-1983-47b7-aab1-189caf4ed330" facs="#m-31dd75dd-6b34-46ab-9530-d497cf811e6e" label="lyrics-like">suórum accusántibus, ante conspé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f833f52c-295b-42ba-b895-0a997ab3828e" facs="#m-5263d465-0adb-4e55-8378-fd0bc8375014" label="ambiguous">strum. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-2f136b18-b00d-4ab7-a64a-75c4023a7239" facs="#m-ab451c9f-0059-4ea5-b934-5c8d36ed860f" label="lyrics-like">ctum divinae cleméntiae tuae faci¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf4472b9-aea6-48fc-9346-3ad8c1c030e5" facs="#m-5c6805f3-0256-41b4-b501-6b28eb4c49cf" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-209294ba-791e-46fe-88a0-5a5548217e03" facs="#m-315ace55-d7ea-4d1d-8d1d-91875bf345ba" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui non mortem, sed pae-] pietáte dignáre; ut, qui nos cinerem</l><l xml:id="m-5e223ec4-4d15-4e84-8693-bcb527ce4547" facs="#m-63b06f92-ec14-4c39-8345-d0a003d265fb" label="lyrics-like">esse, et ob pravitátis nostrae demé¬</l><l xml:id="m-df05124b-0e6e-4c43-9cc9-bd3bd2a8b2a5" facs="#m-164c74e1-2556-40a4-afe3-d05ec5d4a194" label="lyrics-like">Uniténtiam desideras peccató¬</l><l xml:id="m-f78f684a-890f-4530-af1e-c73cf43b3c17" facs="#m-778e54df-9cbd-4c37-a533-3a87c6410ce9" label="lyrics-like">rum: fragilitátem conditiónis hu¬</l><l xml:id="m-2a6b5ecf-f4c9-4581-a528-d2b4d61d6a0c" facs="#m-43256b66-deb4-469b-a516-f98a90c19182" label="lyrics-like">ritum in púlverem reversúros co¬</l><l xml:id="m-41c9eff6-22a3-452f-b7a0-1fbe0cb5ad63" facs="#m-bde08d68-7961-4e34-a204-95d8c4ab07d4" label="lyrics-like">gnóscimus; peccatórum ómnium</l><l xml:id="m-7f794a14-9280-4d71-bb6d-a2d5bdcfd73a" facs="#m-0b6ad881-aa5d-45ab-b9f2-6935b40c8818" label="lyrics-like">mánae benignissime réspice; et hos</l><l xml:id="m-ec64c138-b6c4-4a69-86e7-bdec0b6016c9" facs="#m-b05cd56d-dc51-4be6-8043-d6951353bde1" label="lyrics-like">véniam, et praémia paeniténtibus</l><l xml:id="m-32b65b2a-f5d3-4819-b646-f1c0725920ff" facs="#m-161f5863-88e1-481b-a770-751fc1f7add7" label="lyrics-like">cineres, quos causa proferéndae</l><l xml:id="m-5bfcaf1b-c20c-435d-9e75-83b10ec96d57" facs="#m-d3a63958-bdaf-42c3-8b5e-5761180f7144" label="lyrics-like">humilitátis, atque promeréndae vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a382784-f761-4f92-b5d1-a1e78eae66ec" facs="#m-99546725-d867-4b10-bea8-f984e66b6ae8" label="lyrics-like">repromíssa, misericórditer cónsequi</l><l xml:id="m-683052d4-b1b3-4835-b754-9f54b78b0f98" facs="#m-2a62dc6e-bb53-4e99-b455-5e749e16f81e" label="lyrics-like">mereámur. Per Christum Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-c7dd3519-dede-480d-a484-83b79c0f7327" facs="#m-d31b55a1-8dcf-4753-8579-5ade5828ad72" label="lyrics-like">niae, capitibus nostris impóni de¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a6fc930-0de4-4b86-aa84-43b2ad5cbf57" facs="#m-a088308f-108f-4f18-8e1f-371d04e25d3f" label="lyrics-like">cérnimus, bene Fdicere pro tua! nostrum. B. Amen.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
